Package: DelphiRF
Title: Delphi - Revision Forecast
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Jingjing", "Tang", email = "jtang2@andrew.cmu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Maintainer: Jingjing Tang <jtang2@andrew.cmu.edu>
Description: Forecasts the eventual value of public-health surveillance
    observations that are still subject to revision. From a revision archive
    of successive releases, it builds a reporting triangle with revision
    features and fits weighted lasso quantile regressions that predict each
    observation's value at a chosen target lag, returning quantile forecasts
    and weighted interval scores.
